@api = http://127.0.0.1:52107

### Valid order with a coupon
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ada@example.com","isbn":"9780441013593","quantity":2,"couponCode":"autumn10"}

### Three invalid fields
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ada.example.com","isbn":"9780441013599","quantity":0}

### Not enough stock after the first order
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"grace@example.com","isbn":"9780441013593","quantity":2}
